          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Verso, address, Judaeo-Arabic",
          "value": "<p>To my master and brother Ab\u016b Ya\u1e25ya Nahray ben Nissim ben Nahray.</p>\n<p>May God prolong his life and maintain his assistance and benefaction.</p>\n<p>From Israel ben Nathan ben Nahray, his cousin.</p>",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
