      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Verso, address, Arabic",
          "value": "<p>Naj\u0101 ibn al-\u1e24usayn al-An\u1e63\u0101r\u012b. Mu\u1e25ammad ibn Naj\u0101.</p>\n<p>To my master and brother Ab\u016b Ya\u1e25ya Nahray ben Nissim ben Nahray the Maghrib\u012b.</p>\n<p>May God prolong his life and maintain his might and assistance and happiness and benefaction.</p>\n<p>From Israel ibn Sahl\u016bn the Maghrib\u012b.</p>\n<p>To Fust\u0101t, if God wills it.</p>",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
